{
 "about": "Incoming messages for the scenario suite: one entry per situation the workflow must handle, written in the style of the replies the course discusses (no real mailbox data, owner's decision 2026-10-14). `expect` says what a correct proposal does: the reply type(s) it may name, the action(s) it may take, the gates it must raise, and phrases it must never contain. The agency works the AI niche; data/comms/tests/scenarios.json gives each entry its AI creator, brand, thread and deal facts. Influencer entries run on top of a real channel from the database and a first email we sent; brand entries on top of a real observed sponsor and a pitch we sent.",
